      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Two sets of Nickel Plate Railroad tracks once crossed Otterbein; one removed, the other now used by Kankakee, Beaverville and Southern Railroad.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11,
